nsform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 4px; outline: none;'></div><div>• 14. They have recently recorded their first CD: ➔ <span class='question-badge'>14</span> <input type='text' id='ans-14' style='width: 60px; padding: 5px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 4px; outline: none;'></div><div>• 15. They participate in charity events: ➔ <span class='question-badge'>15</span> <input type='text' id='ans-15' style='width: 60px; padding: 5px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 4px; outline: none;'></div></div></div><div style='background-color: #f1f2f6; border-left: 5px solid #00cec9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;'><strong style='display: block; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 5px;'>Questions 16-20</strong><span style='font-size: 0.9rem; color: #57606f;'>Choose the correct letter, <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong> or <strong>C</strong>.</span></div><div style='display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 25px;'><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>16</span> 16. Elizabeth Arnold thinks people join a choir at work because it gives them a chance to:</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-16' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='16'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> have a break from work.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> improve their singing.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> make business contacts.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>17</span> 17. How does a company benefit from setting up a choir?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-17' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='17'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> improved relationships between co-workers.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> less sick leave taken by employees.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> increased commitment to the company.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>18</span> 18. How many members does the John White choir have?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-18' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='18'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> 5.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> 12.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> 19.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>19</span> 19. When do the choir have their rehearsals?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-19' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='19'><div class='option-item' data-va